              "text": "1. ping: Reachability",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`ping -c 4 host` sends 4 ICMP echo requests",
                "Shows ==reachability==, ==packet loss==, **RTT**"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Failed ping",
              "text": "ICMP can be blocked: a failed ping does not prove the host is down."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. curl Flags",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
